BT /C 8.5 Tf 0.12 0.12 0.12 rg 48 414 Td (function subscribeToUserData\(normalizedUsername\) {) Tj ET
BT /C 8.5 Tf 0.12 0.12 0.12 rg 48 403 Td (    if \(firestoreUnsubscribe\) firestoreUnsubscribe\(\); // Clean up old listeners) Tj ET
